"sutampa tik per vieną UTC parą. Naudotojo vardas ir el. paštas saugomi "
"atviru tekstu."

#: includes/class-sentinel-admin.php:1636
msgid "CSV-Export:"
msgstr "CSV eksportas:"

#: includes/class-sentinel-admin.php:1636
